WEBVTT

00:01:28.710 --> 00:01:29.650
Mister.

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:31.440
Damn you!

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:33.440
Let's settle this once and for all,

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:33.940
Professor.

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:39.340
There's no need.  I've already broken the code.

00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:45.310
So that's Twenty Faces.

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:47.330
Chiko...

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:53.360
You did good.

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:55.570
Mister...

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:24.870
I press this and the place blows up.

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:33.000
Curse you.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.790
Hurry and save your friend.

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:36.510
OK.

00:02:41.670 --> 00:02:44.720
Abandon the experiment and leave this place for good.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:47.900
Are you really able to sacrifice your daughter?

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:50.350
If you won't stop, then I have no choice.

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:20.060
You're safe now.

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:27.390
You're not getting away.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:39.150
Don't kill them.

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:44.240
I'll shut it down.

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:46.350
If you put that away,

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:48.530
I'll hand over the two girls.

00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:56.450
You were in Twenty Faces' gang, huh?

00:03:56.450 --> 00:03:58.430
What happened to the things you stole?

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.570
It was all donated to museums.

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:04.000
The Boss kept a few pieces for himself,

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.970
but the majority of it went where it belongs.

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:09.830
That's why there's no "legacy."

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:13.700
So, what's with that old man?

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:17.400
When Twenty Faces was a young man, he was developing weapons for the military.

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:20.480
He was that professor's lead pupil.

00:04:22.720 --> 00:04:28.130
Twenty Faces' true legacy is the research he performed and the data he obtained.

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:29.350
The Boss's research?

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:30.540
Yes.

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:32.480
That's what the professor is after.

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:35.450
Then, I take it you are as well?

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:40.050
What I want is a different set of research data from the professor's continued work.

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:44.750
The research hadn't gone beyond experimentation on animals at the time.

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:46.800
After Twenty Faces went into hiding,

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:51.770
the professor went on to human experimentation, and he was most likely successful.

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:57.470
Move in right away if they try anything funny.

00:04:57.470 --> 00:04:58.020
Yes, sir.

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:06.150
What's Twenty Faces going to do?

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:22.460
This way!

00:05:37.530 --> 00:05:39.270
That's enough.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.360
Chiko...

00:06:01.370 --> 00:06:03.920
He took the research this far?

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:11.020
Turning humans into weapons?

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:13.930
Changing the flesh something more akin to a machine.

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:15.820
It wasn't easy.

00:06:15.820 --> 00:06:16.580
You were one of them?

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:21.040
I eventually reached a dead end.

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:28.840
But...

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:30.360
...I'm not just giving up.

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:33.600
Heh.  Those monsters...

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:35.370
"Monster," huh?

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:46.590
I guess I'm a monster too, eh?

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:50.660
This is the result of one of his first experiments.

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:53.600
You experimented on your own body?

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:56.200
I'm a researcher.

00:06:56.200 --> 00:06:58.550
I have to see it through to the end.

00:06:58.550 --> 00:07:01.310
You're a real piece of work, you know?

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:37.810
We start with this.

00:07:49.790 --> 00:07:51.320
Wh-What the heck?

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:02.140
This has been under Tokyo all this time?

00:08:02.140 --> 00:08:04.350
This facility was once used by the military.

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:06.940
What did they do here?

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:08.550
Someone's coming.

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:18.810
Can you have all the entrances blocked off?

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:21.200
Not in a place like this.

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:24.350
We couldn't pull it off even with the entire Tokyo police force.

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:31.650
What are the police doing here?

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:34.860
We should head to a different entrance.

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:10.750
Don't interfere!

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:14.760
He's still just a prototype.

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:17.740
They're just children.

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:25.110
Chiko!

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:35.320
They're both such good children.

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:40.140
I hope you'll stay with me until the experiment is complete.

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:42.310
I'll kill you afterwards.

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:57.180
Well now, the show begins.

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:11.880
An earthquake?

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:17.110
It's too dangerous to stay here.

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:19.220
Let's head to the surface.

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:34.750
Young lady!

00:10:35.350 --> 00:10:37.060
Ah-ah, ah-ah-ah!

00:10:37.060 --> 00:10:38.290
What's that?

00:10:57.100 --> 00:10:58.510
Mister.

00:11:06.510 --> 00:11:08.540
What is that?

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:10.270
Why is that the only place with power?

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:30.080
Are you trying to unseal what I locked away?

00:11:36.180 --> 00:11:38.170
Another failure?

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:39.740
What's going on here?

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:43.690
Let's thoroughly investigate the cause.

00:11:43.690 --> 00:11:45.550
Our hypothesis is flawless.

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:47.410
We'll continue like this.

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:58.730
No!

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:02.550
Something is causing it to fail.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:48.310
Why?

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:51.350
We need to cancel out its natural resonance.

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:08.620
It's not stopping?

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:10.060
Why?!

00:13:17.510 --> 00:13:19.220
Why?

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:27.950
Our current technique...

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:29.490
...is not viable.

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:32.170
Stop the research?

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:32.990
Why?

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:35.990
The light was beautiful.

00:13:35.990 --> 00:13:38.560
But it was also dangerous.

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:41.380
Much too dangerous for us to handle.

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:43.980
If it's too much for you to bear, I'll take over.

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:47.840
We understood nothing.

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:50.760
Trying to control something that's uncontrollable...

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:54.370
How did you create the light?

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:58.830
You were the one who said we'll continue until the military no longer needs us!

00:13:59.680 --> 00:14:01.520
It's for the greater good to halt the experiments.

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:04.020
That's not for you to decide!

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:06.440
The fourth state of water is my hypothesis!

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:08.300
I intend to...

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:12.380
...seal away all my research.

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:34.150
This is something the old Twenty Faces created.

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:37.650
But he had to seal it away before it went this far.

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:40.600
This is the fourth state of water?

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:47.310
I had to start all my research over from scratch after you took it away from me.

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:14.700
Do you know the hardships I faced after that?

00:15:16.460 --> 00:15:19.620
Your assistant disappeared from Japan.

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:21.790
I searched all over for him.

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:24.850
I just asked him to carry materials for me.

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:25.840
He didn't know anything.

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:31.090
But a few years later, I finally found him in Toran.

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:32.950
But it turned out to be a wasted trip.

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:38.750
A Japanese person was murdered in the outskirts of Toran.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:42.710
Would you believe he even insinuated that I was up to something?

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:47.610
They've subsided.

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:49.760
Let's move ahead while we can.

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:06.150
What do you think?  Not a bad view, huh?

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:10.570
The time to confirm it all with my own eyes has come at last.

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:13.070
There's no way to control it.

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:17.490
From grapes, they make the wine.

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:21.290
He has to be stopped!

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:24.000
From coals, they make the fire.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.420
Your arrogance...

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:31.420
From kisses, they make the men.

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:34.180
...will kill many innocent people.

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:37.640
That is the warm law of men.

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:39.430
Why can't you see?!

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:43.350
All right.

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:31.320
Hey, what's that?

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:46.330
Th-This has disaster written all over it.

00:18:22.460 --> 00:18:24.870
What are you doing?  Hurry!

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:34.470
Oh!  It's a success!

00:18:34.470 --> 00:18:36.960
I've succeeded!

00:18:39.160 --> 00:18:42.350
So that's the fourth form of water?

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:54.860
Ah, ah-ah!

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:58.210
The young lady couldn't possibly be in there...

00:18:58.210 --> 00:18:59.610
Akine-san, hurry!

00:19:00.210 --> 00:19:01.840
Amazing!

00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:04.870
Come, show me even more of that light!

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:28.870
Mikamo-san!

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:30.390
Are you all right?

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:30.850
Yeah.

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:37.360
Damn you!

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:38.280
Chiko!

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:39.490
Get down!

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:41.200
Shit.

00:20:13.550 --> 00:20:15.350
Is it over?

00:20:17.220 --> 00:20:21.150
That was Twenty Faces' legacy.

00:20:23.100 --> 00:20:25.370
That old man must have done it.

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:27.160
And Chiko must be with him!

00:20:29.070 --> 00:20:30.540
Wait!

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:38.040
Young lady...

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:48.030
Are you all right?

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:49.080
Yeah.

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:51.560
Of course not!

00:20:55.370 --> 00:20:57.060
Sorry.

00:20:58.800 --> 00:21:01.070
Where did he go?

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:10.880
Mister!
